                                "sense_id": "86cd8b4d-1dbb-342f-9153-f11f020ec697",
                                "text": "\"I was one of them,\" recalled Mr. Detmer, who is now 47. \"When I graduated from high school in 1966, I got my first job working on the assembly line at the I.B.M. plant, where I earned $2 an hour putting together mainframe computers."
                            },
